# Copy to `.env.local` to override where the desktop app's "Get the code"
# button points. `.env*` is gitignored — only this example file is committed.
#
# Defaults (when this is unset):
#   npm run dev / npm run tauri dev  ->  http://localhost:3000
#   npm run build / npm run tauri build -> https://nichefiletools.com
#
# The unlock code is computed by the same public algorithm on both sides, so
# pointing at a local dev server works end to end with no server changes: the
# desktop app verifies the code offline against its own clock.

# VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# VITE_SITE_URL=http://192.168.1.8:3000
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://staging.nichefiletools.com
